anually.'=>'一筆附件記錄被移除，但上傳的檔案仍保存在媒體庫中，需手動審查。' . "\0" . '多筆附件記錄被移除，但上傳的檔案仍保存在媒體庫中，需手動審查。','CRM Contacts'=>'CRM 聯絡人','Contact records stored by Bit CRM.'=>'Bit CRM 儲存的聯絡人記錄。','CRM Leads'=>'CRM 潛在客戶','Lead records stored by Bit CRM.'=>'Bit CRM 儲存的潛在客戶記錄。','CRM Deals'=>'CRM 交易','Deals linked to the contact records above.'=>'與上述聯絡人記錄相關的交易。','Invoice number'=>'發票號碼','Status'=>'狀態','Invoice date'=>'發票日期','Due date'=>'到期日','Amount'=>'金額','Paid at'=>'付款時間','Sent at'=>'寄出時間','CRM Invoices'=>'CRM 發票','Invoices raised on the deals above.'=>'上述交易所開立的發票。','Line item %d'=>'第 %d 項目明細','discount %s%%'=>'折扣 %s%%','tax %s%%'=>'稅率 %s%%','Linked to'=>'連結至','Created'=>'建立時間','CRM Notes'=>'CRM 備註','Notes written on the contact and lead records above.'=>'在上述聯絡人及潛在客戶記錄上所寫的備註。','Title'=>'標題','Details'=>'詳細資料','CRM Activities'=>'CRM 活動','Tasks, calls and meetings recorded on the contact and lead records above.'=>'記錄在上述聯絡人及潛在客戶記錄上的任務、通話及會議。','Type'=>'類型','CRM Attachments'=>'CRM 附件','Files attached to the contact and lead records above.'=>'附加於上述聯絡人及潛在客戶記錄的檔案。','File name'=>'檔案名稱','File URL'=>'檔案 URL','CRM Links'=>'CRM 連結','Links saved on the contact and lead records above.'=>'儲存在上述聯絡人和潛在客戶紀錄上的連結。','URL'=>'URL','Description'=>'描述','CRM Emails'=>'CRM 電子郵件','Emails stored for this address (sent from the CRM or synced from a connected mailbox).'=>'儲存在此地址的電子郵件（由 CRM 發送或從連接的郵箱同步）。','Subject'=>'主旨','Date'=>'日期','Direction'=>'方向','From'=>'寄件人','To'=>'收件人','Cc'=>'副本','Bcc'=>'密件副本','Body'=>'主體','Company'=>'公司','Tags'=>'標籤','Bit CRM keeps the people and businesses you work with in your own WordPress database. The text below is a starting point. Change it so it describes what you really collect, why you are allowed to, and how long you keep it.'=>'Bit CRM 將您合作的人員和企業保存在您自己的 WordPress 資料庫中。以下文字是一個起點。請更改它以描述您實際收集的內容、您被允許收集的原因，以及您保存資料的時間長度。','What we keep about you and why'=>'我們保留關於您的資訊及原因','When you get in touch with us, become a customer, or are introduced to us, we create a record for you in our customer database. It holds your name, email address, phone number, postal address and your role at your company, along with the notes, tasks, calls, meetings, files and links our team saves while working with you. We use this to keep track of our conversations, to follow up on sales, to send you invoices and to stay in contact.'=>'當您與我們聯絡、成為客戶或被介紹給我們時，我們會在客戶資料庫中為您建立紀錄。該紀錄包含您的姓名、電子郵件地址、電話號碼、郵寄地址以及您在公司的職務，還有我們團隊在與您合作時保存的筆記、任務、通話、會議、檔案和連結。我們用這些來追蹤對話、跟進銷售、寄送發票，以及保持聯絡。','If our team connects a mailbox to the database, the emails sent between that mailbox and your address are copied in as well, so your conversation history sits next to your record. This includes the subject, the message text, the sender and recipient details and the names of any attachments.'=>'如果我們的團隊將郵箱連接到資料庫，該郵箱與您的地址之間發送的電子郵件也會被複製進來，讓您的對話歷史與您的紀錄並列。這包括主旨、郵件文字、寄件人與收件人詳細資料以及任何附件的名稱。','Who can see it'=>'誰可以看到','Only the members of our team who have been given access to the customer database can see your record. If we send you a link to an invoice, anyone who has that link can open the invoice.'=>'只有被授權存取客戶資料庫的團隊成員可以看到您的紀錄。如果我們寄給您發票連結，任何擁有該連結的人都可以開啟該發票。','Where your information goes'=>'您的資訊流向','Emails and invoices we send you travel through our email provider. Emails we sync from a connected mailbox are fetched from that mail provider, for example Gmail or Zoho. If you pay an invoice online, the payment is handled by the payment provider shown on the invoice, and that provider receives your name, billing details and the amount. The pages we show you, such as a shared invoice, load their fonts from Google Fonts, which receives your IP address when the page loads.'=>'我們寄給您的電子郵件和發票會經過我們的電子郵件服務提供者。從連接的郵箱同步的電子郵件則從該郵件提供者（例如 Gmail 或 Zoho）擷取。如果您在線上支付發票，付款由發票上顯示的付款提供者處理，該提供者會收到您的姓名、帳單資料和金額。我們展示給您的頁面，例如共享發票，會從 Google Fonts 載入字體，當頁面載入時，Google Fonts 會收到您的 IP 位址。','How long we keep it'=>'我們保存的時間','We keep your record for as long as we are working together and for as long as the law requires afterwards. Invoices, and the records they rely on, are kept for the period that accounting and tax rules demand.'=>'我們會在合作期間及法律要求的期限內保存您的紀錄。發票及其依據的紀錄會依會計和稅務規定保存相應期間。','Your choices'=>'您的選擇','You can ask us for a copy of everything we hold about you, and you can ask us to delete it. When you ask us to delete, we remove your lead and contact records, everything saved on them, and the emails we stored from our conversations. If your record is tied to deals or invoices that we are required to keep, we strip your personal details from those records and keep only the anonymized business information.'=>'您可以向我們索取我們持有的所有關於您的資料副本，也可以要求我們刪除。當您要求刪除時，我們會移除您的潛在客戶及聯絡人紀錄、所有儲存在其上的資料，以及我們從對話中儲存的電子郵件。如果您的紀錄與我們必須保留的交易或發票相關聯，我們會從這些紀錄中刪除您的個人資料，只保留匿名的業務資訊。','Bit CRM works with the built-in WordPress privacy tools. To handle a request, go to Tools → Export Personal Data or Tools → Erase Personal Data and enter the person\'s email address.'=>'Bit CRM 與內建的 WordPress 隱私工具配合使用。要處理請求，請前往 工具 → 匯出個人資料 或 工具 → 擦除個人資料，並輸入該人的電子郵件地址。','Invalid module specified'=>'指定的模組無效','Failed to create tag!'=>'建立標籤失敗！','Tag created successfully'=>'標籤建立成功','Tag not found!'=>'找不到標籤！','Failed to update. Tag not found!'=>'更新失敗，找不到標籤！','Failed to update tag!'=>'更新標籤失敗！','Tag updated successfully'=>'標籤更新成功','Tag deleted successfully'=>'標籤刪除成功','Invalid module'=>'模組無效','The WooCommerce plugin is not installed or activated.'=>'未安裝或啟用 WooCommerce 外掛。','External API access is disabled.'=>'外部 API 存取已停用。','This endpoint is not available for external API access.'=>'此端點無法用於外部 API 存取。','Rate limit exceeded. Please retry shortly.'=>'超過速率限制。請稍後重試。','Received folder or type is not set.'=>'未設定接收資料夾或類型。','Sent folder or type is not set.'=>'未設定寄送資料夾或類型。','Received folder is not set.'=>'未設定接收資料夾。','Sent folder is not set.'=>'未設定寄送資料夾。','Failed to fetch messages, please setup IMAP first.'=>'擷取訊息失敗，請先設定 IMAP。','Failed to get imap client, invalid platform.'=>'取得 IMAP 用戶端失敗，平台無效。','INVOICE'=>'發票','Invoice Number:'=>'發票號碼：','Date:'=>'日期：','Due Date:'=>'截止日期：','Terms:'=>'條款：','Bu